  str_n7_mission_title_12 = "ST2 - Shadows",
  str_n7_mission_desc_2 = "You head to Umbraton, the city shrouded in shadows, after received the letter.",
  str_n7_mission_desc_3 = "After meeting with Bethel, you arrive at the guild's headquarters to prepare for the handover of the Caelestite assets.",
  str_n7_mission_desc_4 = "The headquarters is under Eclipsite attack? What is going on...?",
  str_n7_mission_desc_5 = "Faced with no leads, Luke proposes that you try your luck at the Crossroads Bar.",
  str_n7_mission_desc_6 = "The investigation is at a standstill. You decide to go to the underground auction first with Luke.",
  str_n7_mission_desc_7 = "Rhein has betrayed the Shadowlord? You have to find Bethel and inform her at once!",
  str_n7_mission_desc_8 = "Bethel was also attacked, just as you had feared. It seems a rebellion is now brewing in Umbraton...",
  str_n7_mission_desc_9 = "Upon hearing that the other major guilds were also attacked, you decide to provide support immediately.",
  str_n7_mission_desc_10 = "After receiving further guidance, you arrive at the Steelfire Gang's headquarters. It seems that the heads of the major guilds are being held here...",
  str_n7_mission_desc_11 = "Rhein and Maude are probably attacking the dam at this very moment. Go to the Dam of Scars immediately!",
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_1 = [[
You received a letter from Umbraton inviting you to take over the assets left behind by the Caelestites.
Naroxel has also heard that a unique item known as a simulation room component is being auctioned in Umbraton's underground...]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_2 = [[
This is "The City Shrouded in Shadows."
You have met up with the head of the guild, Bethel, but Eclipsites unexpectedly attack you on your way to Umbraton.
Fortunately, Luke, the commander of a local mercenary squad, showed up in time and decided to accompany you.]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_3 = [[
As you arrive at the guild and prepare for the handover procedures, another Eclipsite attack strikes.
Given that this is such a tightly secured area, can this really be a coincidence?]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_4 = [[
It so happens that Pittman has also come to Umbraton to investigate the mysterious Enhancers, and thus you've gained another ally.
Hoping to find more clues, Luke decides to take you somewhere...]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_5 = [[
You encounter Rhein of the Blue Lion Guild at Crossroads Bar, along with another mysterious person.
They succeed in obstructing your mission, and instead of finding useful clues, you find yourself under attack once again.
It also seems that Bethel has left in an awful hurry...]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_6 = [[
Unable to proceed with your investigation, you and Luke go to the auction house to look for simulation room components, but you run into Rhein and his cohorts again.
This time, they take over the place swiftly and without mercy, and make an announcement: Istvan is dead.]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_7 = [[
After leaving the auction, you hurry to the guild to find Bethel.
You find Bethel in the headquarters and facing assassination. Fortunately, everything seems to be under control for now.]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_8 = "Your worst fear has come true—Rhein has indeed incited the rebellion, and Bethel's men are also among the traitors.\nAs for the Shadowlord, everyone refuses to believe that he is dead.\nYour top priority now is to aid the other guilds under attack and quell the chaos...",
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_9 = [[
Upon arriving at the attacked Lin Guild, it seems that someone has already helped to solve the predicament.
Luke also becomes keenly aware of a new clue and leads you to your next destination: the Steelfire Gang headquarters.]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_10 = [[
You arrive at the Steelfire Gang headquarters and rescue the guild leaders who were abducted at the auction.
Istvan Gang finally makes an unexpected appearance and proceeds to maintain order.
Your next step is now to pursue the perpetrator behind all this at the Dam of Scars!]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_11 = [[
His plans foiled, the enraged Maude swallows the Enhancers.
Under the commanding presence of the Shadowlord, you emerge victorious, and the truth is finally revealed.]],
  str_n7_mission_desc_long_12 = [[
Many questions surrounding this matter remain unanswered... Pittman also decides to continue his investigation.
You obtain the simulation room component you came for, which may be of great use in the future...]],
