Beats Odds to Claim Victory</size>]],
  str_n7_paper_4_3_title = "<size=35><color=#353330>Spearows Win Public Security Award Again</color></size>",
  str_n7_paper_4_4_title = [[
<size=30><color=#353330>Upper Class Underground Auctions Outlawed
Held Secretly For Years as "Salon"</color></size>]],
  str_n7_paper_4_5_title = [[
