  str_n7_activityintro_title = "Event Info",
  str_n7_activityintro_intro = [[
<color=#ee8d1a>Obtaining Underground Arena Honor:</color>
1. During the event period, if you participate in the Underground Arena, your highest Honor each day among the three difficulty levels will be calculated as your final Honor for that day and added to your Total Honor.
2. The Underground Arena refreshes every day. After refreshing, your Underground Arena Honor will also be refreshed for that day.
3. Your Honor in the Underground Arena will accumulate every day, and this amount will be recorded as your Total Honor. Corresponding Path to Glory rewards will unlock after accumulating a certain amount of Total Honor.
<color=#ee8d1a> Underground Arena Gameplay:</color>
1. In the Underground Arena, you'll face enemies who can also traverse tiles and use normal attacks and Chain Combos. Attributes of both sides will automatically be adjusted, and damage from a single attack dealt to the enemy can never exceed 10% of their max HP.
2. There are 3 difficulty levels in this mode, with multiple stages for each difficulty. The higher the difficulty you select and the more stages you complete, the more Honor you'll obtain.
3. The Underground Arena refreshes every day. There is no limit to the number of challenges you can attempt per day on each difficulty level.]],
